From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DrummingBird1 <1979036+DrummingBird1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 05:02:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] cellPad: SDL2 on Windows when SDL2.dll is there, remappable
 keyboard, the mouse as the right stick

- PS3RECOMP_SDL2_RUNTIME (Windows): SDL2's headers at build time, SDL2.dll
  from the exe's folder at run time through function pointers, so the exe
  never imports it. DualShock 4, DualSense and Switch pads work as well as
  Xbox ones; no DLL, PAD_SDL2=0, or an SDL init failure falls back to XInput.
- The keyboard for port 0 no longer lives in the XInput backend. PAD_KEYS=
  <control>=<vk>[+<vk>],... replaces its map (two keys a control, mouse
  buttons are virtual keys too), with cam_* controls for the right stick.
- PAD_MOUSE=<1..100>: the mouse as the right stick while the game window is
  in front: hidden cursor, kept inside the window, recentred only near an
  edge (recentring on every poll read as motion under display scaling).
  PAD_MOUSE_DEBUG=1 logs every motion and stick value.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 CMakeLists.txt       |  16 ++
 libs/input/cellPad.c | 467 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 2 files changed, 398 insertions(+), 85 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 250d8d2c..1014a00e 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -202,6 +202,22 @@ if(PS3RECOMP_FFMPEG_RUNTIME)
     message(STATUS "  FFmpeg:       run-time loaded (headers in ${PS3RECOMP_FFMPEG_INCLUDE_DIR})")
 endif()
 
+# On Windows, cellPad reads controllers through SDL2 when this is on: SDL2.dll
+# from the exe's folder, loaded at run time like FFmpeg, so the build needs only
+# SDL2's headers and an exe without the DLL falls back to XInput. SDL2 adds the
+# DualShock 4, DualSense and Switch pads that XInput does not see.
+option(PS3RECOMP_SDL2_RUNTIME "Windows: controllers through SDL2.dll loaded at run time (needs the SDL2 headers)" OFF)
+if(WIN32 AND PS3RECOMP_SDL2_RUNTIME)
+    find_path(PS3RECOMP_SDL2_INCLUDE_DIR SDL.h)
+    if(NOT PS3RECOMP_SDL2_INCLUDE_DIR)
+        message(FATAL_ERROR "SDL2 headers not found: pass -DPS3RECOMP_SDL2_INCLUDE_DIR=<dir containing SDL.h> "
+            "(the include folder of SDL2-devel-<version>-VC.zip)")
+    endif()
+    target_include_directories(ps3recomp_runtime PRIVATE "${PS3RECOMP_SDL2_INCLUDE_DIR}")
+    target_compile_definitions(ps3recomp_runtime PRIVATE PS3RECOMP_SDL2_RUNTIME)
+    message(STATUS "  SDL2:         run-time loaded for controllers (headers in ${PS3RECOMP_SDL2_INCLUDE_DIR})")
+endif()
+
